<title>PHILIPPINES: Metro Pacific Q1 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Metro Pacific Q1 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>(in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)   5.32 vs 2.79</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)	    1.165 vs 1.406</p>
<p>    Net income			200.5 vs 90.5</p>
<p>Note: Full name Metro Pacific Corp. Company is a holding company with investments in manufacture and sale of pharmaceuticals, banking, property and telecommunications.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8937</p>
</text>
